# DinoGames core

See also `dino-games-coaching.mdc` (how to decide) and `dino-games-tests.mdc` (test patterns).

## Audio UX

Audio must complete before user input is re-enabled.

## CLI commands

Before running shell commands, check current syntax (`<tool> help`, `man`, or `--help`). macOS and Xcode updates change flags and subcommands often (e.g. `xcresulttool`, `simctl`, `launchctl`). Do not assume commands from memory.

After macOS or Xcode upgrades, re-verify simulator destinations instead of reusing hardcoded device IDs:

```bash
xcrun simctl list devices available
xcodebuild -scheme DinoGames -showdestinations
```
